cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use extractmeteobr in your research, please cite this software.
type: software
title: 'extractmeteobr: Extract Area-Weighted Municipal Meteorological Time Series for Brazil'
authors:
  - family-names: Tatsch
    given-names: Jônatan Dupont
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0930-9461'
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/lhmet/extractmeteobr'
url: 'https://github.com/lhmet/extractmeteobr'
abstract: >-
  R package that converts BR-DWGD meteorological NetCDF rasters into
  area-weighted time series for Brazilian municipalities. Provides polygon
  loading, raster cropping and aggregation, missing-cell interpolation,
  physical-area-weighted spatial means, and output in FST format.
keywords:
  - R
  - meteorology
  - Brazil
  - BR-DWGD
  - spatial analysis
  - reproducible research
